    "text": "By Berks Weekly ,\n11 hours ago Packed with Purpose: Adalyn Rose Foundation and ProBerco Partner to Support Grieving Families and Create Meaningful Employment Opportunities for Individuals with Disabilities. The Adalyn Rose Foundation is proud to officially announce a new partnership with ProBerco, a nonprofit organization dedicated to creating employment opportunities for individuals with disabilities throughout the Berks County community. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
